            <note corresp="#d117-f2" n="22" xml:id="d117-f2-content">
                <p>Vyacheslav Mikhailovich Molotov, Soviet Foreign Minister, a participant in the
                    meetings of the Council of Foreign Ministers.</p>
            </note>
